  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let $P$ be the mid-point of a chord joining the vertex of the parabola $y^{2}=8 x$ to another point on it. Then, the locus of $P$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "c1MFg",
      "text": "$y^{2}=2 x$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YRXGN",
      "text": "$y^{2}=4 x$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fUJod",
      "text": "$\\frac{x^{2}}{4}+y^{2}=1$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cqo5L",
      "text": "$x^{2}+\\frac{y^{2}}{4}=1$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the chord be MN. Let other end of chord joining from vertex to it lying on $y^{2}=8 x$ be $N\\left(2 t^{2}, 4 t\\right)$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2012_mat_a54.png\">\r\n\r\n$\\therefore$ Mid-point of $M N=\\left(t^{2}, 2 t\\right)$ $\\therefore \\quad x=t^{2}, y=2 t \\Rightarrow x=\\left(\\frac{y}{2}\\right)^{2}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad y^{2}=4 x$\r\nis the required locus of $P$",
    "image": null
  },
